Error [E0003]: `$old` is not a compiler fact
  --> tests/ui/fact_root_unknown_dollar_word.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print($old)
    |           ^^^^
 Why: `$` marks facts the compiler supplies: the roots `$build`, `$package`, `$phase` and `$program`, and `$` members of a type, function or value such as `T.$layout`
 Fix: Read a fact root such as `$build.os`, or read the fact on its subject, such as `T.$fields`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
